Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.98,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.94,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Warp complete.\N All departments, hurry cross-checks.{for check-ups.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:50.53,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Andromeda's primary engine is stable.\N Interior environment nominal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:54.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine failed to restart. \NPossible critical damage to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:59.04,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Canceling trans-warp interlock \Nand releasing the gravity anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:05.86,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Multiple large ships sighted straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.42,0:02:09.24,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They're Andromeda-class early mass production ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.50,0:02:16.56,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They'll join the Garmillas fleet at\N Mars to form the final defense line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.36,0:02:26.88,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Inform HQ...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:31.40,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,...this ship will head to the Time \NFault facility for emergency repair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.22,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.00,0:02:38.46,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}I'll save the Yamato no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:20.00,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.40,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\i1}You must be with the United Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:27.63,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:29.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:31.96,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:40.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:45.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:53.72,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}During the fight with Domel's fleet, the Yamato was infiltrated by their special forces...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:57.15,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{Mori}...resulting in Chief Operations \NOfficer Mori being taken as a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:02.28,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}I ordered Lt Kodai to rescue\N Chief Operations Officer Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.31,0:04:08.04,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Kodai succeeded on his mission\N and returned to the ship with Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:19.06,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}After the rescue operation, the Yamato left\N the Garmillas sector, and headed to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:25.83,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}To all crewmen of the Yamato, this is Captain Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:28.55,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We've finally reached Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.66,0:04:34.63,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{mitamae}Look, Iscandar is right before your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.28,Karaoke Translation op,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&\3c&H000000&}{mitamae}I want to take this opportunity to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.99,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,{\pos(970,1012)}Then, Yuki's memories won't come back ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.53,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,No, they actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,She recalled the memories she \Nhad lost because of the accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:51.08,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,But she lost the memories of the last 4 years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:54.07,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,About the Yamato, the journey to Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.54,0:04:58.22,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,...and about Chief Tactical Officer Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:02.43,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Maybe it's temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:04.79,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Something might trigger...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:06.78,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The possibility is near zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:10.10,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,That's Dr. Sado's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.24,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Just focus on your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.45,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.13,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We have lots of company today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:27.78,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Their language has been analyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.37,0:05:31.05,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}They're worthy of receiving Zemuria's knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:33.20,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Let's borrow that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.03,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Who is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:43.43,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,That's not a slate. \NIt's like a screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:46.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Those are Gatlantian letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:51.13,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,Gatlantians are man-made soldiers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.13,0:05:54.44,def2,ANALYZER,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...with only{\c&HF7FDAB&} a sense{\c&H00FF00&} of loyalty{\c&HF7FDAB&} and hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:58.56,def2,KIDS,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Farm animals{\c&H00FF00&} with a{\c&HF7FDAB&} \Nhumanoid body{\c&H00FF00&} and green skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:05:59.93,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Analyzer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.23,0:06:01.62,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:05.57,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Gatlantians are ideal pawns in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.52,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}So that Zemurians don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.10,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Zemuria...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.33,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Sounds like the name of this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:18.42,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,This place appears to be Zemuria's memory bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:23.61,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,The Gatlantians were created on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:27.85,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}But the Zemurians broke a taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:32.70,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Type Zorder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:39.88,Karaoke Translation op,BOY,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(956,614)}1,000 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:38.57,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...the most advanced model with a \Nnetwork capable of using telepathic waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:45.42,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It has a complex mental structure, massive \Nmemory capability, and is also capable of spy operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.23,0:06:48.64,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}{Gatlantis wo koeta}He exceeds normal Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:51.28,def2,KIDS,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}He's almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:52.84,def2,KIDS,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&\pos(1072,1052)}...human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:52.84,def2,KIDS,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&\pos(828,1052)}...human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.79,0:06:57.71,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:02.74,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why doesn't it awaken ? \NWhy doesn't it accept me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:12.65,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,The Ark of Destruction{Extinction} comes to life only\N when humans are deemed an evil species.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:18.25,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,It's left for humans to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:25.70,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,No matter how closely we are engineered\N to be like humans, we're still artificial.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:28.93,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,We can't judge humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:31.94,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We can, exactly because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:41.48,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We're incapable of reproduction. \NWe have no love or ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:44.61,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{mottomo}We're the most pure intelligent life form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:52.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{jinrui}Humans created a new kind of human\N to free themselves from their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:10.66,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,Are you going to raise the dead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:15.14,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The Ark of Creation is paired\N with the Ark of Destruction.{Extinction.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:23.31,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{ningen}If it can only hear the voice of a human, I'll sacrifice the woman I love the most...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:29.03,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{hito}...so she can be the judge who delivers justice to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.02,0:08:37.96,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}He was struck by bad \Nkarma for breaking a taboo .
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:44.33,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}A farm animal which can think\N like a human can't remain an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:50.13,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Zorder carried out a revolt, then a war\N between Gatlantis and humans began.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.97,0:08:51.96,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,How is it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.31,0:08:56.49,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,No use. We have to get back to the \NYamato and hook this up to the main host.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:59.60,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Requesting a connection to the main host.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.69,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}This unit can't hold our knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:05.68,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,Hey, you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:07.98,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We're storytellers of Zemuria.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:13.56,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Our duty is to transfer the history of the planet to an entity with worthy intelligence and memory capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:16.64,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,We're inadequate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:22.02,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,They took over Analyzer easily. \NWe can't take it to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.45,0:09:28.56,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,But we need information,\N including the exact location of this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:33.71,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Zemuria's current coordinates are unknown to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.61,def2,NAGAKURA,0,0,0,,What do you mean ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:37.45,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}It's because of the witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:42.34,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}A human traitor helped the Gatlanians revolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.51,0:09:48.27,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}The witch sided with Zorder and hid Zemuria in a mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.88,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,A witch ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.88,0:09:52.34,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Let's take this to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:05.03,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sifar Sabera... \NDo you hear my voice ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:33.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We don't have much time. \NReplicated cells disintegrate quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:41.81,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Remember what humans \Ndid to you, a fellow human...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.90,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...and what they took from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:54.65,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Deliver justice for your rage, sadness, and despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.16,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Let's end our suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.19,0:11:20.51,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Humans rob and kill because of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:26.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Let's end the pain of living on...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:31.59,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...through the salvation called extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:34.86,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:10.32,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,This battle will determine the fate of the\N entire human race throughout the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:15.29,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,Together, we must defend the\N Earth sector for the honor of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.99,0:12:21.53,def2,BARREL,0,0,0,,This battle will decide the rise or fall of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:36.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for political beliefs, so I'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.74,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,But can we really win ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:51.81,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Ichinose, your control was too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:53.71,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.71,0:12:56.51,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The use of the trim lever during\N a maneuver must be within 0.20.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:57.86,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:12:59.64,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,0.20...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:06.78,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,I wish I could replace these useless hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:09.73,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Replace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:14.25,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,I've heard the production of some high performance prosthetic arms has begun in the Time Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:19.87,def2,ICHINOSE,0,0,0,,{kihon}They're meant for the injured, but if I volunteer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:34.56,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Survey the Gatlantis gravitational field fluctuation,\N and then adjust the approach limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.89,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,It's your seat, Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.80,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.23,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,I'm sure you will...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:01.65,def2,MIKI,0,0,0,,That's Captain Okita Juzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:06.94,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I know the name. \NHe died on this ship during a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:25.04,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,What are you expecting ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:28.97,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.83,0:14:32.80,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,If I had died there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:42.38,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,You want my favor for saving me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:44.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,I've been wondering for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.54,0:14:48.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Gatlantians deny and mock love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:57.04,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That may be proof of knowing what love is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:04.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,They might hate love because of pain and suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:14.49,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The Yamato's landed on a planet called Zemuria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:18.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,You know this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:23.60,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}...and the fact that it was the home \Nplanet of Gatlantis, don't you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:31.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,It was once a beautiful planet,\N lush and green, just like Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.91,0:15:35.25,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,That was more than 1,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,And you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:48.74,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}...the last human of Zemuria...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.06,0:15:54.86,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Even though you are a copy of a traitor, you're a pure entity with genuine Zemurian blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:16:00.86,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}We grant you, the last human of Zemuria, the \Nwhole record of the planet we've been protecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.59,0:16:09.14,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unlike you humans we Gatlantians\N have no ability to reproduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:16.36,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, he will become me. \NHe is my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:27.41,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}"Gatlantis is not bound by love. Therefore, they can build a fair and peaceful society."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:32.79,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}That was Zorder's claim, but he \Nhimself, couldn't free himself from love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.92,0:16:40.30,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\i1}The King of Gatlantis has a wife and child ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:45.64,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\i1}The female traitor played mother to a clone baby, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:53.59,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you want to save this woman and the child, tell us where your army's going to gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:59.19,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}It was a shameful act. \NBut the Zemurians were desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:04.69,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Having his loved ones taken \Nhostage, Zorder made a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:07.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,A choice ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:19.08,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}Zorder's choice was futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:27.35,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Using Zorder's information, the Zemurians\N quelled the Gatlantian revolt quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:34.63,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}They eventually turned against Zorder, \Nand broke their promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:36.40,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}His wife and his child were...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.58,0:17:56.78,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Despite everything, he survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:01.89,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}He left Zemuria with the surviving Gatlantians.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:09.93,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}That wasn't the end. He had an objective...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:16.95,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}...an objective to revive the Ark of Destruction, \Na legacy of ancient Archelious...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.77,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}{horobino}...which is believed to lie at the edge \Nof empty space with no star in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:23.77,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:35.40,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:39.52,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,This darkness is like the inside of your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:45.78,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Instead of destroying the universe,\N your frozen heart needs to be broken free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:47.02,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:52.60,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Please give up this path you're on.{ stop this path you seek.}{a deed like this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.98,0:19:15.24,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,The judgment is made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:22.38,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,This is the end of the quest \Nof more than 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:23.86,def2,GAILANE,0,0,0,,We must accept...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:25.12,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:32.80,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,We have the data. Make a copy of\N Sabera with her memories intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:38.42,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,If she can control the \NArk of Destruction, that will be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.75,0:19:46.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,If you encounter any problems, try again. \NWe can make as many copies as we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:54.87,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{moto}Humans are incomplete in the first place.\N Their pitiful lives are cursed with love.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.14,0:20:20.29,def2,GIRL,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}Zemuria was doomed, and it was \Nshrouded in an ominous white gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.18,0:20:36.31,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,As long as humans act like humans, \Nthey can't break free from the sin of loving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:45.06,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Who created such a thing ? \NWho proliferated{ propagated} it throughout the universe ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:51.41,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The ancient Archelious experiment ended in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:55.20,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,An evil breed must be terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:01.79,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Then we will wait for the birth of a new breed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:09.83,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{kono}A new intelligent life form which can bring true order and stability to this universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.72,0:21:16.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The Comet Empire's megalopolis is\N built around the Ark of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.28,0:21:21.35,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,{subeteno}It's the embodiment of true love, \Nwhich can burn away all pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.29,0:21:26.47,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Sabera.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:44.02,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,The anti-warp field has disappeared. \NGravitational incline near Gatlantis, intensifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:50.01,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,A.I. prediction matches B-7.\N The White Comet has begun to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:51.79,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.58,0:21:55.79,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,All ships, maintain distance\N from the critical escape line !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.02,def2,MEGUMI,0,0,0,,Gravitational wave, incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:09.05,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Contact the Mars Defense Force !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.43,0:22:14.63,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,The Comet Empire is leaving the Jupiter sector, and is expected to warp into the Mars sector !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.63,0:22:15.70,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,Stay on alert !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:44.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:44.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(344,1038)}Gatlantis, the Cursed Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:18.48,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Cottony clouds drift high across the sky\N{\i1}Sora takaku nagareru kieyuku wata no kumo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.48,0:23:31.24,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Holding out both hands, I stretch out in the falling leaves\N{\i1}Ryoote wo age ah senobi shita rakuyou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:51.54,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}As the house lights come on, I wish to meet people smiling at each other\N{\i1}Akari tomoru mado waraiau hito ni aitai to omou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:24:05.67,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Believing in a miraculous enounter{meeting} to become real, I shout out for love\N{\i1}Sou kanau hazusa kiseki no deai ni ai sakenda
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:25.63,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Luminous lives meet and bond with each other\N{\i1}Kagayaku jinsei no meguriawase tsumuideyuku
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.63,0:24:41.66,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s keep on living our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei wo tayumazu ni susumi tsuzukeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:25:02.28,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Let’s begin the story of our lives\N{\i1}Bokura no jinsei no monogatari wo saa hajimeyou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:58.83,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(1260,468)}Kodai {\3c&H000000&}Susumu:\NMori Yuki:\NShima Daisuke:\NAnalyzer:\NSaijo Miki:\NKatsuragi Touko: \NSaito Hajime:\NNagakura Shiori:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.13,0:22:58.83,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1290,148)}Ono Da{\3c&H000000&}isuke\NKuwashima Houko\NSuzumura Kenichi \NCho\NMoriya Satomi\NKaida Yuko\NTochi Hiroki \NAmagai Kazusa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:04.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a3\pos(1282,392)}{\3c&H000000&} Todo Saki:\NKanzaki Megumi\NIchinose Mina: \NYamanami Osamu: \NOkita Juzo:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:04.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1306,194)}{\3c&HFF0000&} {\3c&H000000&}Takagaki Ayahi \N Hayashibara Megumi\NKurosawa Tomoyo\NEbara Masashi\NSugo Takayuki
