Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:09.68,Karaoke Translation op,CAST3,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFF0000&\a5\pos(1304,134)}{\3c&H000000&}Kamiya Hiroshi\N Terasoma Masaki\NSuwabe Junichi\NTezuka Hideaki \NShibata Hidekatsu \NKaida Yuko \N Ichinose Hiroaki\NFujimura Kento\NYano Masaaki\N  Ikeshita Ririko\N Matsumoto Yuki
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.73,0:25:34.18,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(970,662)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.54,0:25:36.67,def2,BOY,0,0,0,,{\c&H00FF00&}It sings the song of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.06,0:25:38.70,def2,BOTH,0,0,0,,{\c&HF7FDAB&}It's called {\c&H00FF00&}Golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:40.12,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Where is it now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.12,0:25:42.55,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,The killing will never end.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.55,0:25:45.21,def2,SAKI,0,0,0,,This is our ship, a human one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:47.05,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Raise the hull !
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.78,0:25:47.73,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103\pos(964,462)}Episode 21
